| UHD: the 4K clips (3840x2160, 30 pictures, 8-bit and 10-bit) through the
| block: every picture checked, then checked pipelined (-p: converting
| one picture while the block decodes the next), then timed (-t), then
| timed pipelined. Ten frames (-f 10: a 4K frame is 12 MB, 16 MB at 10-bit). Reports
| to ResultK.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 98304K -max 98304K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultK
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -f 10 -p -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultK <Obey$Dir>.clips.uhd.trace
